WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:00.923
- Alright everybody.

00:00:00.923 --> 00:00:02.370
Let's close out with something fun.

00:00:02.370 --> 00:00:04.983
I found scrolling social,
this is what I'm liking.

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:10.350
Two years ago, a
Pennsylvania woman was living

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:12.630
in a converted ambulance,
traveling the country,

00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:15.360
when she saw a TikTok of
a guy looking to propose

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:18.720
and marry a woman, sight unseen.

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:21.450
Immediately, she was all in.

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:24.150
Some may say this was
a questionable choice,

00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:26.490
but it turns out those people
would be wrong 'cuz it worked

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:28.320
out better than either of
them could have imagined.

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:29.490
Just look.

00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:31.743
- [Danielle] The wedding
weekend was surreal.

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:34.530
The following two years

00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:36.210
we almost never left each other's sides.

00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:38.130
We traveled all over the
country in the ambulance,

00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:39.540
built out a second tiny home,

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:41.760
and we went on so many
adventures together.

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:44.430
Neither of us thought we would
last this long by any means,

00:00:44.430 --> 00:00:46.380
but I am beyond happy that we have.

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:48.613
Happy two year anniversary. To us.

00:00:48.613 --> 00:00:49.887
(audience cheering)

00:00:49.887 --> 00:00:52.560
- Wow! We have these free
spirited lovebirds on the line

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:56.190
right now watching on WTAE
Pittsburgh's Action News 4.

00:00:56.190 --> 00:00:57.233
What's up y'all?

00:00:57.233 --> 00:00:58.849
(crowd applause)

00:00:58.849 --> 00:01:00.450
- Hey!

00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:01.283
- [Kelly] Oh my God.

00:01:01.283 --> 00:01:02.280
First of all, Danielle, Gunnar,

00:01:02.280 --> 00:01:03.330
y'all are adorable.

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:04.650
I'm leading with that.

00:01:04.650 --> 00:01:06.330
I have to ask you though,

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:09.510
did you think this would actually last?

00:01:09.510 --> 00:01:11.160
- No, not at all.

00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:11.993
Not at all.

00:01:11.993 --> 00:01:14.370
We expect to be here two years later.

00:01:14.370 --> 00:01:15.203
- [Kelly] I know!

00:01:15.203 --> 00:01:16.036
I, just, a crazy thing.

00:01:16.036 --> 00:01:16.869
So what's the secret?

00:01:16.869 --> 00:01:18.060
Why has it worked out?

00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:20.610
- Yeah, so I think what
has really worked for us,

00:01:20.610 --> 00:01:22.410
the secret sauce, is that we came

00:01:22.410 --> 00:01:25.140
into it with absolutely no expectations,

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:27.450
and we really let our friendship blossom,

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:28.560
and then that evolved

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:32.550
into what we currently
have now, which is love.

00:01:32.550 --> 00:01:33.390
- [Danielle] I also think

00:01:33.390 --> 00:01:36.990
that our communication skills
have a lot to do with that.

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:39.000
I think that this is probably,

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:41.950
hopefully, the healthiest
relationship we've both ever had.

00:01:42.870 --> 00:01:45.690
And yeah, so no expectations,
and amazing communication

00:01:45.690 --> 00:01:47.664
I'd say would be the secret sauce, yeah.

00:01:47.664 --> 00:01:50.760
- Also your incredible
rock and roll haircut.

00:01:50.760 --> 00:01:52.110
I just need to talk about it.

00:01:52.110 --> 00:01:54.150
Danielle, you have my favorite hair

00:01:54.150 --> 00:01:55.830
I've ever seen on this show.

00:01:55.830 --> 00:01:58.830
Congratulations. Thank y'all so much.

00:01:58.830 --> 00:02:00.270
It's just such a sweet story,

00:02:00.270 --> 00:02:02.250
and so interesting and different.

00:02:02.250 --> 00:02:04.150
I'm liking your post right now, right?

00:02:06.826 --> 00:02:07.659
- [Danielle] Yay!

00:02:07.659 --> 00:02:08.492
- [Kelly] That's not all though.

00:02:08.492 --> 00:02:10.680
Our season long partner
Pilot Pen, makers of FriXion

00:02:10.680 --> 00:02:12.660
to Go-To Erasable Pen of
the Kelly Clarkson Show

00:02:12.660 --> 00:02:14.880
want to celebrate people who throw caution

00:02:14.880 --> 00:02:16.140
to the wind, just like y'all.

00:02:16.140 --> 00:02:17.550
So, they're gonna give
you a thousand dollars.

00:02:17.550 --> 00:02:18.400
How's that sound?

00:02:19.777 --> 00:02:22.542
- Oh my God!

00:02:22.542 --> 00:02:23.523
- [Gunnar] Thank you so much!

00:02:23.523 --> 00:02:24.822
- Awesome, thank you guys!

00:02:24.822 --> 00:02:25.655
And thank you to all our guests,

00:02:25.655 --> 00:02:28.860
are Dame Helen Mirren,
Adam Brody and Aly and AJ.

00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:29.693
Y'all have a great day.

00:02:29.693 --> 00:02:31.767
If it's not, well, try and change it.

